cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "The Epistolary Transfer Graph: A Typed Directed Multigraph for Modeling Precedence and Attribution Among Claims, with an Exploratory Spectral Mapping"
abstract: >-
  A typed, weighted, directed multigraph for precedence, influence, citation
  and related transfer relations among letters, claims, motifs and packets,
  with an exploratory mapping from paths and cycles to formant triples.
  Conceptual proposal with a Python reference implementation; the spectral
  mapping has not been empirically validated.
